1
00:00:58,358 --> 00:01:00,985
The locals here have believed in spirits for ages .

2
00:01:01,945 --> 00:01:04,196
Maybe even before there was any religion .

3
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:15,500
But , the meaning of spirits for Isan people

4
00:01:15,584 --> 00:01:18,377
might not be the same as for most .

5
00:01:34,603 --> 00:01:39,023
We believe everything that goes beyond nature

6
00:01:39,983 --> 00:01:41,734
is all called spirits ,

7
00:01:42,945 --> 00:01:45,905
not just the souls of dead people .

8
00:01:54,957 --> 00:01:58,125
We believe spirits are in every single thing ,

9
00:02:03,632 --> 00:02:04,633
In houses ,

10
00:02:06,093 --> 00:02:07,552
in forests , in mountains ,

11
00:02:12,432 --> 00:02:13,475
in trees ,

12
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:17,311
in rice fields .

13
00:02:18,021 --> 00:02:20,690
Every area has spirits . All of it .

14
00:02:23,694 --> 00:02:28,675
In 2018 , a documentary team traveled

15
00:02:28,699 --> 00:02:32,368
all over Thailand to study the lives of shamans .

16
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:36,933
After interviewing many shamans ,

17
00:02:36,957 --> 00:02:41,252
the team decided to study the life of Nim .

18
00:02:42,963 --> 00:02:45,715
The shaman of ' Goddess Ba Yan ' .

19
00:02:49,887 --> 00:02:53,180
For Isan people , spirits have many types ,

20
00:02:53,265 --> 00:02:56,643
such as Phee Fah , Phee Tan ,

21
00:02:57,060 --> 00:03:00,938
Phee Sua , Phee Ban , Phee Muang ...

22
00:03:01,064 --> 00:03:02,174
They 're all spirits .

23
00:03:03,066 --> 00:03:07,111
There are good spirits that protect us ,

24
00:03:07,530 --> 00:03:09,405
and evil spirits

25
00:03:10,073 --> 00:03:14,326
that haunt us and make us sick .

26
00:03:14,452 --> 00:03:16,704
And the spirit within you , who is it ?

27
00:03:17,790 --> 00:03:20,166
Let me say it in central dialect ,

28
00:03:20,250 --> 00:03:23,085
They call it ' possessing . '

29
00:03:23,629 --> 00:03:25,630
In Isan , they call it ' Ma Tiam . '

30
00:03:26,924 --> 00:03:29,967
I 'm the shaman for Goddess Ba Yan .

31
00:04:12,510 --> 00:04:14,887
Ba Yan is an ancestral spirit .

32
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:17,348
She 's a good spirit

33
00:04:17,432 --> 00:04:21,060
who has protected the villages for a long time .

34
00:04:23,521 --> 00:04:27,233
Actually , no one knows who She is or where She 's from .

35
00:04:27,317 --> 00:04:30,402
But they 've paid respect to Her for many generations .

36
00:04:38,662 --> 00:04:41,140
' Shaman Bloodline '

37
00:04:41,164 --> 00:04:46,479
A documentary about the shaman inheritance in a family .

38
00:04:46,503 --> 00:04:52,383
My family has been Ba Yan 's shaman for many generations .

39
00:04:52,467 --> 00:04:54,010
Ever since I was born ,

40
00:04:54,094 --> 00:04:56,178
I saw my grandmother as Her medium .

41
00:04:56,263 --> 00:05:00,767
Ba Yan only chooses women to be Her medium .

42
00:05:00,851 --> 00:05:03,770
Lots of locals would come to see us .

43
00:05:04,354 --> 00:05:08,315
Every year we do a ceremony . A very big one .

44
00:05:09,026 --> 00:05:11,235
The locals will ask

45
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:14,238
how the village will fare for the coming year .

46
00:05:14,322 --> 00:05:16,866
After my grandmother died ,

47
00:05:17,868 --> 00:05:21,162
the next person to inherit Ba Yan was my aunt .

48
00:05:22,956 --> 00:05:29,003
After my aunt , the next shaman was supposed to be Noi , my elder sister ,

49
00:05:30,714 --> 00:05:33,007
but Noi declined the inheritance .

50
00:05:33,425 --> 00:05:35,426
Ba Yan then chose ..

51
00:05:36,553 --> 00:05:38,721
Me instead .

52
00:05:42,935 --> 00:05:47,354
Don 't shamans have to shake their bodies or change their voices ?

53
00:05:47,439 --> 00:05:49,231
You might have watched too much TV .

54
00:05:49,858 --> 00:05:51,525
It doesn 't have to be like that .

55
00:05:52,069 --> 00:05:56,655
As you 've seen , people come see me every day .

56
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:59,200
Some come to heal their sickness .

57
00:05:59,284 --> 00:06:02,578
Some ask for blessings or wishes .

58
00:06:03,371 --> 00:06:04,663
Some repay their wishes

59
00:06:04,748 --> 00:06:07,416
with offerings of a jar of liquor and a chicken .

60
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:09,836
Tell me what happened ?

61
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:12,839
My husband found this cobra and made liquor out of it .

62
00:06:12,923 --> 00:06:14,608
I told him not to drink it , but he didn 't listen .

63
00:06:14,632 --> 00:06:17,176
His arms and legs went numb . He doesn 't have any strength .

64
00:06:17,803 --> 00:06:19,595
Where did you get it from ?

65
00:06:20,347 --> 00:06:21,513
I got it from the cemetery .

66
00:06:22,015 --> 00:06:25,309
This is the cause of your misery , paying for your bad karma .

67
00:06:25,685 --> 00:06:28,896
Because you 're drinking the soul that resided in this animal .

68
00:06:38,656 --> 00:06:40,657
Can you treat every illness ?

69
00:06:40,743 --> 00:06:42,785
If someone has cancer and they come to see me ...

70
00:06:44,121 --> 00:06:45,204
they will die for sure .

71
00:06:48,541 --> 00:06:52,628
I can only treat illnesses that happen from the unseen

72
00:06:53,046 --> 00:06:54,797
such as black magic ,

73
00:06:54,882 --> 00:06:58,217
or if a spirit has harmed you , I can cure it .

74
00:06:58,301 --> 00:07:01,345
But if it 's a normal illness , I advise you go see a doctor .

75
00:08:04,827 --> 00:08:09,080
I never thought of being a shaman before . Actually , I didn 't want to be one .

76
00:08:09,331 --> 00:08:13,000
There was a period when I was always sick .

77
00:08:13,085 --> 00:08:16,921
No matter what , I couldn 't get better . It was so painful

78
00:08:17,339 --> 00:08:22,384
to the point that I wanted to run away to get away from it all .

79
00:08:22,552 --> 00:08:23,760
Why does it have to be me ?

80
00:08:24,096 --> 00:08:25,137
But I didn 't succeed .

81
00:08:25,222 --> 00:08:28,765
So I agreed to let Her take me . Actually , it is great .

82
00:08:28,934 --> 00:08:31,936
Now I get to pray every day and do ceremonies .

83
00:08:32,020 --> 00:08:36,858
And people come to see me , asking for help when they have troubles .

84
00:08:38,861 --> 00:08:40,819
Now I consider it to be very good .

85
00:08:42,322 --> 00:08:43,155
I 'm at ease .

86
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,532
I can 't even remember why I first didn 't accept Her ,

87
00:08:46,201 --> 00:08:47,202
why I was mad at Her .

88
00:08:57,219 --> 00:09:03,807
SEAMSTRESS

89
00:09:16,564 --> 00:09:24,564
THE MEDIUM

90
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:32,246
We 're going to Wiroj 's funeral . Who is he ?

91
00:09:32,330 --> 00:09:33,956
Wiroj is ...

92
00:09:35,918 --> 00:09:39,336
the husband of my elder sister , Noi .

93
00:09:39,712 --> 00:09:42,714
He found out last year that he had cancer .

94
00:09:42,966 --> 00:09:44,258
I 'm sorry for your loss .

95
00:09:45,052 --> 00:09:49,013
I don 't know why all the men in the Yasantia family .

96
00:09:49,431 --> 00:09:51,140
Wiroj Yasantia die under bad circumstances .

97
00:09:51,683 --> 00:09:56,103
Wiroj 's grandfather was stoned to death by laborers .

98
00:09:57,147 --> 00:10:00,191
Wiroj 's dad , when his factory went belly-up ,

99
00:10:00,733 --> 00:10:02,859
he burned the factory for insurance money .

100
00:10:03,486 --> 00:10:06,697
When he was caught , he poisoned himself to death .

101
00:10:07,157 --> 00:10:09,325
As for Mac , Wiroj 's eldest son ,

102
00:10:10,827 --> 00:10:12,829
he died in a motorcycle accident several years ago .

103
00:10:36,644 --> 00:10:37,728
How have you been ?

104
00:10:38,230 --> 00:10:42,024
Haven 't seen you for so long . You 've forgotten your family ?

105
00:10:42,109 --> 00:10:44,443
If no one died , we 'd never see each other .

106
00:10:44,694 --> 00:10:47,404
- Is this tray ready ? - Yeah , you can take it inside .

107
00:10:48,781 --> 00:10:52,743
- You always forget your relatives . - Can you stop nagging ?

108
00:10:57,957 --> 00:11:00,126
He 's the pastor from the church Noi goes to .

109
00:11:01,044 --> 00:11:02,503
Thank you for coming .

110
00:11:04,214 --> 00:11:07,424
Mink , please get a chair for the pastor .

111
00:11:16,018 --> 00:11:17,019
Mink .

112
00:11:17,269 --> 00:11:18,270
How are you ?

113
00:11:18,478 --> 00:11:22,189
Your mom told me you were the first one to find his body .

114
00:11:22,274 --> 00:11:23,399
I 'm okay .

115
00:11:28,155 --> 00:11:31,782
My family has 3 siblings .

116
00:11:31,949 --> 00:11:33,409
There 's Manit , the eldest .

117
00:11:34,036 --> 00:11:36,745
If you smoke a lot , you can 't tell one thing from another .

118
00:11:36,829 --> 00:11:39,540
Water ? Some water ?

119
00:11:39,957 --> 00:11:42,126
Noi is the middle child , and I 'm the youngest .

120
00:11:42,710 --> 00:11:43,919
See ..

121
00:11:44,003 --> 00:11:47,089
Wiroj , Noi 's husband , just died .

122
00:11:47,465 --> 00:11:52,636
Before this , Mac , Noi 's son , passed away .

123
00:11:52,929 --> 00:11:57,808
Now , Noi is left with Mink , her only daughter .

124
00:11:58,643 --> 00:12:04,022
Actually , Noi and Wiroj married a bit late .

125
00:12:04,107 --> 00:12:05,691
Once they married ...

126
00:12:06,484 --> 00:12:10,529
Noi took over the dog meat shop from her mother-in-law ,

127
00:12:10,780 --> 00:12:13,031
Wiroj 's mother .

128
00:12:13,991 --> 00:12:15,451
I don 't know why she did that .

129
00:12:15,743 --> 00:12:17,971
The government doesn 't allow it , but Noi still secretly does it .

130
00:12:17,995 --> 00:12:20,706
My sisters , they don 't get along very well .

131
00:12:20,790 --> 00:12:26,212
They have had some kind of disagreement ever since who knows when .

132
00:12:26,296 --> 00:12:32,509
I 've tried to talk to them to get them to reconcile , to make up .

133
00:12:33,220 --> 00:12:39,683
- Make sure they 're yours . - I won 't take someone else 's .

134
00:12:39,767 --> 00:12:41,310
Thank you for coming .

135
00:12:43,688 --> 00:12:44,689
Auntie .

136
00:12:46,941 --> 00:12:49,318
Mom wants you to get stuff from my house .

137
00:12:49,402 --> 00:12:52,279
She wrote it all down and where everything is .

138
00:13:13,050 --> 00:13:14,051
Hello , Auntie Nim .

139
00:13:23,019 --> 00:13:24,020
Here .

140
00:13:24,521 --> 00:13:26,605
- You already closed the door , right ? - Yes .

141
00:13:26,689 --> 00:13:29,107
- Lucky won 't go outside , right ? - It won 't .

142
00:13:30,693 --> 00:13:34,696
You brought the wrong cloth . I wanted the thicker one .

143
00:13:34,781 --> 00:13:36,740
Why don 't you go get it yourself then ?

144
00:13:43,373 --> 00:13:44,956
Uncle , what the hell are you saying ?

145
00:13:46,418 --> 00:13:48,126
No one said anything , Mink .

146
00:13:48,211 --> 00:13:49,795
What the fuck did you say ? Say it !

147
00:13:50,213 --> 00:13:51,755
I didn 't say anything .

148
00:13:51,839 --> 00:13:55,426
Just mind your own business . Are you talking shit about me ? !

149
00:13:55,635 --> 00:13:57,678
Who ? No one 's said anything .

150
00:13:57,762 --> 00:13:59,564
- He cursed at me . - Ihaven 't done anything ...

151
00:13:59,639 --> 00:14:00,640
You called me a whore !

152
00:14:00,723 --> 00:14:02,266
Mink ! Stop it !

153
00:14:02,350 --> 00:14:03,475
Mink , don 't !

154
00:14:04,018 --> 00:14:05,977
I didn 't call you that !

155
00:14:08,190 --> 00:14:09,690
Get him out of here , mom !

156
00:14:09,774 --> 00:14:10,775
Mink , let 's go .

157
00:14:10,817 --> 00:14:14,403
- Mink , go . Leave first . - I 'm not leaving . He cursed at me !

158
00:14:14,904 --> 00:14:17,406
No one 's said anything at all .

159
00:14:17,490 --> 00:14:21,159
- Dammit ! Get out of here ! - Mink , calm down .

160
00:14:21,244 --> 00:14:24,205
- Mom , let go of me ! - Calm down , Mink .

161
00:14:25,623 --> 00:14:27,874
He cursed at me .

162
00:14:28,418 --> 00:14:29,876
He didn 't .

163
00:14:29,961 --> 00:14:33,964
Does Mink usually drink a lot ?

164
00:14:35,258 --> 00:14:37,968
I know she drinks , but I didn 't know it was this much .

165
00:14:38,386 --> 00:14:40,471
This is the first time Mink 's caused a scene .

166
00:14:40,847 --> 00:14:41,513
I see .

167
00:14:41,848 --> 00:14:42,849
Go ahead .

168
00:14:43,433 --> 00:14:44,434
See you around .

169
00:14:47,019 --> 00:14:48,061
Drive safely .

170
00:14:49,606 --> 00:14:50,607
Okay .

171
00:15:14,506 --> 00:15:15,507
Mink .

172
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:19,761
Mink .

173
00:15:22,597 --> 00:15:23,598
Mink .

174
00:15:54,587 --> 00:15:55,588
Mink .

175
00:16:19,654 --> 00:16:20,821
Who died ?

176
00:16:21,448 --> 00:16:23,782
The blind old woman whose house is behind the temple .

177
00:16:25,284 --> 00:16:26,993
How did she die ?

178
00:16:27,912 --> 00:16:28,995
I don 't know .

179
00:16:53,062 --> 00:16:54,063
Mink .

180
00:16:55,607 --> 00:16:56,608
Mink !

181
00:17:31,017 --> 00:17:35,270
Wiroj ' Yasantia .

182
00:18:13,685 --> 00:18:14,893
Nim , what are you doing here ?

183
00:18:20,066 --> 00:18:21,483
What are you doing in Mink 's room ?

184
00:18:22,735 --> 00:18:24,277
Why are you going through her things ?

185
00:18:24,361 --> 00:18:28,532
I asked you a question . Why don 't you answer ?

186
00:18:28,658 --> 00:18:30,139
Why aren 't you saying anything ? Gosh !

187
00:18:30,201 --> 00:18:32,410
What are you looking for ? Tell me ...

188
00:18:38,375 --> 00:18:39,376
Here .

189
00:18:40,002 --> 00:18:41,003
See ?

190
00:18:43,798 --> 00:18:45,549
Do you know what this is ?

191
00:18:45,675 --> 00:18:46,676
What ?

192
00:18:48,010 --> 00:18:49,928
What are you doing ? Both of you get out .

193
00:18:50,012 --> 00:18:51,763
- Mink , hold on . - Mom , leave .

194
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:55,517
Mink , you 've started to have nightmares and hear strange things , right ?

195
00:18:55,602 --> 00:18:57,352
No ! Nothing ! Mom , get out .

196
00:18:57,436 --> 00:18:58,019
Mink ...

197
00:18:58,104 --> 00:18:58,895
Get out .

198
00:18:59,021 --> 00:19:00,146
Get out !

199
00:19:01,065 --> 00:19:02,608
Must you film everything , seriously ?

200
00:19:09,991 --> 00:19:12,576
You know what the turmeric is for , right ?

201
00:19:16,914 --> 00:19:19,875
You must tell me if Mink shows any strange symptoms .

202
00:19:24,088 --> 00:19:25,089
Noi !

203
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:28,634
She 's my child . I can take care of her . You should leave .

204
00:19:31,596 --> 00:19:34,848
What is it that Mink hangs in her closet ?

205
00:19:34,932 --> 00:19:36,474
It 's a turmeric called Pa Ta Ba .

206
00:19:36,559 --> 00:19:40,103
We believe it can protect us from spirits

207
00:19:40,187 --> 00:19:42,355
and other evil things .

208
00:19:44,233 --> 00:19:46,401
Why the hell did they come into other people 's room ?

209
00:19:46,485 --> 00:19:49,279
They went through my stuff , too . Dammit !

210
00:19:49,572 --> 00:19:50,781
It 's so freaking lame .

211
00:19:51,658 --> 00:19:52,908
Right ?

212
00:19:55,578 --> 00:19:57,746
Why did you put the Pa Ta Ba in your room ?

213
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:04,753
What they did , it 's so childish . They 're supposed to be the adults here .

214
00:20:07,799 --> 00:20:11,217
At the funeral the other day , why were you staring at that blind lady ?

215
00:20:12,679 --> 00:20:14,429
What blind lady ?

216
00:20:23,314 --> 00:20:24,940
Do you see someone standing over there ?

217
00:20:37,036 --> 00:20:37,869
Yes .

218
00:20:38,037 --> 00:20:39,454
I see someone there .

219
00:20:40,497 --> 00:20:41,623
Why ?

220
00:20:51,008 --> 00:20:54,697
The team went over the footage

221
00:20:54,721 --> 00:20:58,348
and found Mink showing some strange behavior .

222
00:21:05,231 --> 00:21:07,691
What do Mink 's recent symptoms mean ?

223
00:21:10,402 --> 00:21:13,989
From what I 've gathered , they can be several things .

224
00:21:14,073 --> 00:21:17,533
Does that mean Ba Yan will move to Mink ?

225
00:21:23,625 --> 00:21:24,708
I don 't know .

226
00:21:27,670 --> 00:21:32,442
The team had an idea . If a shaman inheritance is real ,

227
00:21:32,466 --> 00:21:38,013
they might be able to record the manifestation .

228
00:21:38,890 --> 00:21:43,518
They decided to film Mink and her family , too .

229
00:21:52,194 --> 00:21:53,195
Hey .

230
00:21:53,570 --> 00:21:55,092
Are you going to film me all the time ?

231
00:21:55,572 --> 00:21:56,614
Most of the time .

232
00:21:56,866 --> 00:21:58,950
Just make yourself com fortable .

233
00:22:01,578 --> 00:22:03,246
Tell me about your job .

234
00:22:03,330 --> 00:22:04,331
Sure .

235
00:22:04,707 --> 00:22:07,500
I work at the Recruitment Center .

236
00:22:07,584 --> 00:22:10,211
RECRUITMENT CENTER

237
00:22:10,296 --> 00:22:13,339
All day I assign work for people to do .

238
00:22:18,846 --> 00:22:19,847
Number 6 .

239
00:22:23,600 --> 00:22:24,601
Hello .

240
00:22:27,646 --> 00:22:30,023
I wake up at 5 a.m. I wake up early .

241
00:22:30,191 --> 00:22:33,026
Eat and get into work around 7 , 8 a.m.

242
00:22:35,654 --> 00:22:38,406
In the afternoon there aren 't many people . So I have some free time .

243
00:22:38,490 --> 00:22:41,076
I 'm not that tired with my work .

244
00:22:43,746 --> 00:22:45,038
And do you like your job ?

245
00:22:45,456 --> 00:22:46,457
Yeah .

246
00:22:46,540 --> 00:22:49,250
I think I 'm happy helping others find jobs .

247
00:22:50,586 --> 00:22:51,502
You 're telling the truth , right ?

248
00:22:51,587 --> 00:22:53,714
Of course ! I sound like a beauty queen , huh ?

249
00:22:55,007 --> 00:22:58,009
How do you feel towards people who are shamans , like your aunt ?

250
00:22:58,635 --> 00:22:59,636
Shamans ?

251
00:23:00,847 --> 00:23:01,848
To be honest ,

252
00:23:02,223 --> 00:23:04,140
I think it 's nonsense . I don 't think it 's real .

253
00:23:04,516 --> 00:23:08,937
Out of the blue , they do weird dance moves . Acting like Hanuman . It 's so weird .

254
00:23:09,021 --> 00:23:12,899
I 've also heard people say that there 's a Doraemon shaman .

255
00:23:14,861 --> 00:23:15,862
Hilarious !

256
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:17,570
What 's a Doraemon shaman ?

257
00:23:17,905 --> 00:23:19,197
Well , it 's a Doraemon shaman .

258
00:23:19,615 --> 00:23:22,117
I guess when they 're taken over , they sing the theme song .

259
00:23:22,493 --> 00:23:23,744
I can speak in tongues too .

260
00:23:24,036 --> 00:23:25,037
